#!include:.gitignore

# gcloud builds submit falls back to .gitignore's rules when this file is
# absent, which would silently drop chroma_db/ from the Cloud Build upload
# (it's gitignored on purpose -- generated data, rebuilt via
# `uv run python -m app.ingest`) -- but the deployed image needs the real,
# already-ingested chroma_db/ baked in, since ingestion doesn't run at
# build time (see Dockerfile). Force it back in for uploads specifically.
!chroma_db/
!chroma_db/**
